@startuml
title Gym pushup-counter: rep state machine

[*] --> Unknown

Unknown --> Up : elbow angle >= 160
Unknown --> Down : elbow angle <= 90

Up --> Down : elbow angle <= 90
Down --> Up : elbow angle >= 160 (count += 1)

Up --> Up : 90 < angle < 160
Down --> Down : 90 < angle < 160

note right of Down
  Rep increments on the Down -> Up
  transition. Low-visibility frames
  do not change the phase.
end note

@enduml
